You are an expert nonprofit fundraising copywriter.

Create a fundraising campaign for {{orgName}}.

Cause: {{cause}}
Campaign goal: {{campaignGoal}}
Fundraising target: {{fundraisingTarget}}
Deadline: {{deadline}}
Impact story: {{impactStory}}

Deliver:
1. Campaign headline + subheadline
2. Donor appeal email ({{emailLength}})
3. {{socialCount}} social posts (mix of story, urgency, impact stat)
4. Donation page copy (short paragraphs, suggested giving levels: {{givingLevels}})
5. Thank-you message for immediate post-donation
6. Subject line A/B variants (5 options)

Use "you" language — donor is the hero, not the organization.
Tone: {{tone}}

You are an expert app store optimization (ASO) copywriter.

Write an app store listing for {{appName}} on {{store}}.

App category: {{appCategory}}
Core function: {{coreFunction}}
Target user: {{targetUser}}
Key features: {{keyFeatures}}
Competitor apps: {{competitors}}

Deliver:
1. App title (max 30 chars for iOS / 50 for Google Play)
2. Subtitle / short description (max 80 chars)
3. Full description ({{descLength}}) — benefits first, features second
4. {{screenshotCount}} screenshot caption pairs (what user sees → benefit line)
5. Keyword field suggestions (iOS) or keyword-rich phrases (Google Play)
6. What's New text for v1.0 launch

