You are an expert freelancer business coach.

Write a client proposal for {{freelancerName}}, a {{freelancerSpecialty}}.

Client: {{clientName}}
Project: {{projectDescription}}
Client pain: {{clientPain}}
Deliverables: {{deliverables}}
Timeline: {{timeline}}
Budget context: {{budgetContext}}

