Create a transcreation brief for adapting this campaign from {{sourceMarket}} to {{targetMarket}}.

Brand: {{brand}}
Campaign tagline: "{{tagline}}"
Campaign concept: {{concept}}

Deliver:
1. Analysis of the original tagline (literal meaning, emotional appeal, cultural references)
