Write a professional email for the following scenario.

Scenario: {{scenario}}
Sender role: {{senderRole}}
Recipient: {{recipient}}
Tone: {{tone}}
Key points to include:
{{keyPoints}}

Desired outcome: {{desiredOutcome}}

