Write a job description for the role of {{jobTitle}} at {{companyName}}.

Department: {{department}}
Location: {{location}}
Employment type: {{employmentType}}

Key responsibilities:
{{responsibilities}}

Required qualifications:
{{qualifications}}

Tone: {{tone}}

Include:
1. Compelling opening paragraph (why this role matters)
2. Responsibilities ({{respCount}} bullet points)
