Write a {{duration}}-second elevator pitch for {{presenterRole}}.

Company/product: {{product}}
Problem solved: {{problem}}
Target customer: {{customer}}
Unique advantage: {{advantage}}

Deliver {{versionCount}} versions:
1. {{tone}} tone (for {{audience}})
2. Casual/conversational (for networking events)
3. One-liner (under 15 words, for Twitter bio or name tag)

